(v)each business for which the Authority has granted approval to the merchant bank under section 55V(1)(e) of the Act and the approval is subject to conditions that include the merchant bank having to treat the balance‑sheet asset value or exposures (whichever is higher) of the business as part of its aggregate non‑financial business size;
(vi)each business carried on by any major stake entity of the merchant bank, other than a business mentioned in section 55V(1)(a), (b), (c) or (d) of the Act, where —
